      "oracle": "Non-skipping parent directly checks all6 mode/metadata cells and3 real shared/exclusive lock probes; compares complete logical names/bytes, validates contextual token purpose/subject/digest, requires Windows exact-absent NO_LOCAL_STORE, and cannot hide optional child skips.",
