      "execution": "Actual named parent PASS in both Windows architectures, with fresh missing-store and shared/exclusive exclusion controls."
    },
    {
      "clause": "Task-context assesses declared task/shared/config/member scope while unrelated files do not broaden invalidation.",
      "source": "core/artifacts/internal/operations/input_scope_test.go:TestTaskCheckScopedSourceChangesDoNotRestartUnrelatedWork and TestTaskCheckConfigAdditionsAndDirectoryMembershipInvalidateScopedResult",
      "oracle": "reportedChecks actually calls task-context; unrelated source stays scoped_unchanged, changed shared source becomes scoped_changed, declared membership/config additions invalidate, latest fail and implementation progress remain truthful, scope/evidence remain incomplete/unverified.",
      "execution": "Both named parents PASS on all six platforms."
    },
    {
      "clause": "Exact/batch reads never manufacture current worktree qualification and context reads stay bounded/inert.",
      "source": "core/artifacts/internal/operations/task_check_test.go and task_context_test.go",
      "oracle": "Exact/batch preserve original failed report without definition_current; context handles changed specification without rebasing or review cascade, ignores33MiB unrelated snapshot input, refuses oversized packet until sufficient budget, discloses unscoped prerequisites and does not execute command-source strings.",
      "execution": "Actual named parents PASS on all six platforms."
    },
    {
      "clause": "Owner documentation states actual metadata/token/applicability effects without changing locking to satisfy prose.",
      "source": "core/artifacts/internal/operations/engine.go comments/openStore/sharedObservation; task_context.go/task_check.go/input_scope.go; read/read.go issue",
      "oracle": "Source inspection joins exact native-module blobs to M94/current. Context token writes are separate from exact reads; Darwin may create lock metadata, Windows observation uses existing metadata, Linux locks existing repository directory. Task-context states bounded advisory source applicability and exposes omitted_context/checks_are_verified:false.",
      "execution": "Read matrix, read-only Windows and bounded scope tests observe these same concrete traits."
    }
